The Board of Directors of the Company at their meeting held today, i.e., Wednesday, 28th October, 2026 had inter alia considered and approved: 

  The Unaudited Financial Results of the Company along with the Limited Review Report thereon for the Quarter and Half-Year ended 30th September, 2026;

  The appointment of Azhar Yusuf Dhanani (DIN: 07694732) as Additional Director (Non- Executive Non Independent Category) of the Company;

  The Draft Notice of Postal Ballot;

  The appointment of scrutinizer for E-Voting in Postal Ballot and the payment of fees to them;

  The cut-off date for the purpose of serving notice of Postal Ballot and for E-Voting;

  Other Businesses.
